                                "sense_id": "7b6ea795-e12b-35bf-ae31-8157f428ba6b",
                                "text": "They stood on line, and slept and ate and cellphoned, all night and into the day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22fe59ea-8337-4761-81ec-6ea4af760125",
                                "sense_id": "7b6ea795-e12b-35bf-ae31-8157f428ba6b",
                                "text": "That information — including estimates that cellphoning drivers caused 955 fatalities and 240,000 accidents in 2002 — was finally pried loose this week by a freedom of information lawsuit."
